    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῡσόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυσός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make wrinkled,
			shrivel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.92
